OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FMorning cloud quickly clearing
OL,6,Fto leave a dry and sunny day across
OL,7,Fthe region. The sunshine may turn hazy
OL,8,Fat times. Feeling pleasant for most,
OL,9,Fwith a light northerly breeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMostly
OL,12,Fcloudy Monday, with rain possible
OL,13,Fovernight. This clearing to sunny
OL,14,Fspells Tuesday and Wednesday, with the
OL,15,Fchance of a few showers. Temperatures
OL,16,Fnearer average for the time of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
